    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to The Green Way,</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Where your farming dreams await! Start with a humble plot of land and transform it into a flourishing agricultural empire. Cultivate crops, tend to livestock, and sell your produce to build wealth and reputation in the community. But farming is just the beginning; immerse yourself in a world where every decision impacts your success and lifestyle. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Key Features:</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Farm Management</strong>: Plant and harvest a variety of crops, manage livestock, and optimize your farm for maximum efficiency.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Business Expansion</strong>: Expand your holdings by purchasing more land and increasing your production capabilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Market and Shop Management</strong>: Sell your goods at local markets or open your own shop. Negotiate prices and build relationships with customers to grow your reputation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Home and Lifestyle</strong>: Upgrade your farmhouse, purchase vehicles, and decorate with luxurious items as your wealth grows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Land Customization</strong>: Buy building plots, design your land, and construct houses, walls, towers, markets, and more. Create a personalized and unique farmstead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Community Engagement</strong>: Interact with neighbors, participate in festivals, and contribute to the local economy to become a respected member of the community.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Achievements and Challenges</strong>: Complete challenges and earn achievements that showcase your farming prowess and business acumen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Create Your Legacy</strong>: From a small-time farmer to a magnate of agriculture, forge your path in The Green Way. Explore, expand, and experience the joys and challenges of rural life as you build a legacy that will be remembered for generations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>-Some Gameplay Features GIFs - :</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Farming Lifecycle System:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3111980/extras/2524b121f463d8a533402d9fc2d40874.poster.avif?t=1752089703\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3111980/extras/2524b121f463d8a533402d9fc2d40874.webm?t=1752089703\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3111980/extras/2524b121f463d8a533402d9fc2d40874.mp4?t=1752089703\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3111980/extras/33ac1c3723c95a52de3807158de2df24.poster.avif?t=1752089703\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3111980/extras/33ac1c3723c95a52de3807158de2df24.webm?t=1752089703\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3111980/extras/33ac1c3723c95a52de3807158de2df24.mp4?t=1752089703\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong><br><strong></strong><br><strong>In-Game Economy</strong>\u00a